                "text": "Questions every reporter should ask Democrats: \n\n1) Should millionaires keep receiving the enhanced ACA premium tax credit?\n2) Why did you set these Covid-era credits to expire this year?\n3) Should taxpayers subsidize health insurance for an early retiree couple who, despite being retired, still makes more than $84,600?",
