                "retweet_count": 172,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Obamacare has been a hot topic in the news lately. Ahead of Nov. 1 when open enrollment for health care plans begins in most states, let's clear up some misconceptions about why Americans with ACA plans will see higher premiums in 2026.\n\nSpoiler alert\u2014Democrats aren't telling the truth.",
