                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The following year, in the ironically named Inflation Reduction Act, Democrats made the tax credit expire on January 1, 2026. This meant that millionaires could continue receiving subsidies even after Biden ended the Covid public health emergency in 2023. https://t.co/3QJFRorGJ6",
