                "text": "These tax credits are sent directly to health insurance companies\u2013Americans never see these subsidies. After insurers pocket this money, they\u2019re incentivized to deny patients\u2019 claims, increasing fraud in the program and leaving taxpayers holding the bill.\nhttps://t.co/e8yPTGE1NF https://t.co/Ghvh59dAGB",
