                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Another wildly inaccurate talking point from Democrats is that millions of Americans will be kicked off Obamacare due to these enhanced subsidies expiring. This is blatantly false.\n\nCOVID-era subsidies will expire, not Americans' health insurance.",
