                "text": "Congratulations to Admiral Brian Christine of Alabama on being sworn in as the U.S. Assistant Secretary for Health and head of the U.S. Public Health Service Commissioned Corps.\n\nProud to see an Alabamian leading efforts to strengthen and modernize America\u2019s public health.",
