                "text": "Thanks to this initiative in the Working Families Tax Cuts Act, Alabama has been awarded $203 million to increase critical access to high-quality health care in our rural communities.\n\nThis historic funding will help strengthen maternal and obstetric care, address the root causes of chronic disease, improve health care outcomes, and expand telehealth services for families across our state.",
