                "reply_count": 26,
                "retweet_count": 15,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In honor of Mental Health Awareness Month, I partnered with my friend @SenFettermanPA to reintroduce the Stop the Scroll Act. This bipartisan legislation would simply create a mental health warning label requirement for social media platforms and would ensure all users, especially adolescents, are provided access to mental health resources.\n\nIn May, I also had the privilege of hosting @SecArmy Dan Driscoll at Redstone Arsenal in Huntsville. Redstone is indispensable to advancing our mission of ensuring America\u2019s military readiness and unmatched lethality, and I\u2019m proud to champion this critical work in the Senate.\n\nAs a longtime supporter of the Birmingham Northern Beltline, I was proud to view the progress and receive and update on the ongoing construction. I will continue to work alongside local and state leaders to help this project become a reality.",
